bind Collect Digital Evidence: Evidence Type, Evidence Size, Custody Status, Security Level, Legal Hold
bind Preserve Digital Evidence: Custody Status, Integrity Score, Retention Period
bind Analyze Digital Evidence: Custody Status, Analysis Time
bind Dispose Digital Evidence: Custody Status, Disposal Method
Evidence Type: Document, Image, Video, Audio, Log File
Evidence Size: integer between 1 and 1000
Custody Status: Collected, Preserved, Analyzed, Released, Disposed
Integrity Score: float between 0.0 and 1.0
Security Level: Confidential, Restricted, Unclassified
Access Count: integer between 0 and 100
Legal Hold: Yes, No
Analysis Time: float between 0.1 and 24.0
Retention Period: integer between 30 and 3650
Disposal Method: Shredding, Wiping, Deletion
